    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview:</strong><br><br>Get ready to hire monkeys to defend the base from waves and waves of bubbles in this top-down tower defense game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406560/extras/2889bd89dc783948f32767cb4187ae35.poster.avif?t=1739757772\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406560/extras/2889bd89dc783948f32767cb4187ae35.webm?t=1739757772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406560/extras/2889bd89dc783948f32767cb4187ae35.mp4?t=1739757772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy controls: Navigate the game through easy to learn controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406560/extras/34361d20bb89b44b32bd14b286b96f84.avif?t=1739757772\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple towers: Strategize from the variety of towers available. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406560/extras/32681062585bbcce02222297beb9cb4b.avif?t=1739757772\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower upgrades: Enhance the performance of any tower to its full potential.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406560/extras/511a9113343e1ca4d0ef51c0c075e561.avif?t=1739757772\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different enemies: Defeat the enemy bubbles with differing stats from each other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406560/extras/87ebfedddc20252e8d3a889b4ece88b8.avif?t=1739757772\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
